FreeGLM is a derived adaptation built directly on Qwen-MM-Plugins. It preserves
and extends the upstream multimodal Agent Skills and MCP servers, and adds
Zhipu GLM-4.6V-Flash as an optional vision backend for vision_chat / ocr /
grounding, including provider routing, native remote-video
input, local frame fallback, and ZHIPU_* configuration/verification wiring.

